{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c940647dceec9b24","type":"text","x":0,"y":-340,"width":1160,"height":180,"text":"# 04 · Cycle BDI d’un Writer\nExemple fictif : date de réunion ORION. Une date inconnue ne doit pas être inventée.\nCe cycle ne s’impose pas à Parser et Scribe.","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d6b5089543aadb5e","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":380,"height":220,"text":"## Perception\nMission via Orchestrator, EmailAnalysis, email et fil autorisés.","color":"5"},
		{"id":"a2c41e1fab0de95a","type":"text","x":520,"y":0,"width":380,"height":220,"text":"## Beliefs\nDemande sur ORION ; date connue ou inconnue.\nLecture du monde autorisé, sans écriture directe.","color":"5"},
		{"id":"de35abd73fd590b2","type":"text","x":1040,"y":0,"width":380,"height":220,"text":"## Desires\nRépondre avec exactitude ; respecter les droits ; ne pas s’engager sans accord.","color":"5"},
		{"id":"68e98b1969917d4a","type":"text","x":1560,"y":0,"width":380,"height":220,"text":"## Délibération\nExaminer les informations et les contraintes ; déterminer le plan réalisable.","color":"5"},
		{"id":"24cefaa72875c071","type":"text","x":2080,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"text":"## Plan A · Répondre\nSource autorisée et date confirmée : sélectionner le fait et sa sourceRef.","color":"5"},
		{"id":"37d78debc5ea2579","type":"text","x":2080,"y":310,"width":400,"height":240,"text":"## Plan B · Clarifier\nDate inconnue : question précise via Orchestrator.\nAttendre l’utilisateur, sans inventer.","color":"2"},
		{"id":"8e22280f4789217c","type":"text","x":2600,"y":150,"width":400,"height":240,"text":"## Intention retenue\nPréparer le plan ou demander l’information.\nRéviser après correction ou nouvelle donnée.","color":"5"},
		{"id":"99b8a3c4e7db4fc9","type":"file","x":3120,"y":150,"width":390,"height":240,"file":"04 - Contrats JSON/ResponsePlan.md","color":"5"},
		{"id":"f92adde383594dc7","type":"file","x":520,"y":690,"width":380,"height":220,"file":"03 - Monde et connaissances/SharedWorldState.md","color":"4"},
		{"id":"a2bdf11cc5184fc0","type":"file","x":1560,"y":690,"width":380,"height":220,"file":"03 - Monde et connaissances/KnowledgeService.md","color":"4"},
		{"id":"da4587eee08a470f","type":"file","x":0,"y":690,"width":380,"height":220,"file":"02 - Agents/WriterAgent.md","color":"5"},
		{"id":"1685f582606a0f68","type":"text","x":2600,"y":690,"width":400,"height":250,"text":"## Retour et révision\nOrchestrator relaie feedback et réponses.\nMises à jour communes contrôlées ; résultats dépendants à réexaminer.","color":"6"},
		{"id":"33cbdbdd2c87ba6e","type":"file","x":3120,"y":690,"width":390,"height":250,"file":"05 - Conception/Suivi des taches et reprise.md","color":"2"}
	],
